
​Explicit Transaction Logging: The API must state exactly every transaction it makes.
​Funding Split: 84% goes to infrastructure and the administrator (Dustin Ross Wysocki), and the remaining percentage goes to the seven chosen Service Personnel and humanitarian charities.
​Daily Paycheck Verification: Users can test and verify their paychecks at the end of every day.
​Mandatory Timekeeping: This system replaces all existing punch-out clocks; users must use this once live.
​Global Reach: The infrastructure and compliance are worldwide.
​Double-Capture Verification: Every single scan requires a double-capture command to verify the transaction.
